{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhonghua-e-o055","title":"三府议举孝廉本以德行不复限以试经","accounts":[{"id":"zhonghua-a-5d1b5e1c282b3604389a","label":"正文","text":"三府议举孝廉本以德行不复限以试经","evidence":["zhonghua-q-fa71fe5b3fa697ef6ee3"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-701990db5ccc6c1b09b3","label":"正文","text":"华歆以为孝廉当以经试恐学业遂废，若有秀异可特征用；帝从其言","evidence":["zhonghua-q-8eaa141c0540313bee90"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0340","role":"持异议进言者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-8eaa141c0540313bee90"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-fa71fe5b3fa697ef6ee3","zhonghua-q-8eaa141c0540313bee90"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhonghua-q-fa71fe5b3fa697ef6ee3","source_order":[13,178,0],"order":2888}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0340","name":"华歆","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhonghua-q-8eaa141c0540313bee90","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-cad21310752f6babb80b","layer":"original","quote":"歆以为：“丧乱以来，六籍堕废〖6〗；当务存立〖7〗，以崇王道。夫制法者，所以经盛衰〖8〗。今听孝廉不以经试，恐学业遂从此而废。若有秀异，可特征用。患于无其人，何患不得哉！”帝从其言。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":177,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-fa71fe5b3fa697ef6ee3","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-cad21310752f6babb80b","layer":"original","quote":"三府议：“举孝廉，本以德行，不复限以试经〖5〗。”","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":177,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
